OL,3,GNEWSAMan, 87, who died after being hit
OL,4,Aby car was a 'much-loved grandfather'
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement issued through Police
OL,7,FScotland, his family said he was a
OL,8,F"much-loved father, grandfather and
OL,9,Ffriend to many who knew him in the
OL,10,FLarbert area" and said he would be
OL,11,F"sorely missed".
